  "ai.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 ye AI de ka dilanen ye pewu.<\/0> Orion-81 yɛrɛ ka kode ɲɛ bɛɛ sɛbɛnna ni Claude Code ye, daminɛbaga ye ɲɛminɛ kɛ. Kurun, kaarti, ja ɲɛnɛ ani mankan bɛɛ bɔra dilanminɛnw de fɛ, Claude Code ye minnu sɛbɛn. Daminɛbaga de bɛ sugandi min ka dilan; Claude Code bɛ cogo ɲini. Open-source jatekɛlaw a sinsinnen bɛ minnu kan, olu sɛbɛnnen bɛ duguma 'AI ma minnu dilan' kɔrɔ. Fɛn kelen bɛ to ka lajɛ, ani a bɛ jira kɛnɛ kan: tolon kode <1>lisansi lajɛli<\/1> min bɔra GPL misali fɔlɔ la.",
