  "d.th2bvi": "Tilayɔrɔw, ɲɔgɔn nɔ ta: L1, suguya id, fatɔ jate + dugu jate, ɲɛ, minɛn sigiyɔrɔ taamasyɛnw, kurun id, kurun fatɔ jate + kurun dugu jate, kurun minɛn sigiyɔrɔ taamasyɛnw. Ɲɛ ye '-' ye STOCK ye, 'p<k>' ye palɛti ta k ye, walima hex jate wɔɔrɔ ye minnu dɔgɔ ye. Tilayɔrɔ ye caadi ye ni a ye '00' ye (danw), '-' ye (ɲɛ, kurun) walima lankolon ye (minɛn sigiyɔrɔw); tilayɔrɔ caadi min bɛ non-caadi laban kɔ, olu bɛ bila, u fɔlɔ tɔw bɛ to. Kurun tilayɔrɔw bɛ yen suguya dɔrɔn na min na hangar yɔrɔ bɛ. Sugandili min suguya tɛ se ka ta, o bɛ kalan i n'a fɔ STOCK.",
