  "economy.todayHead": "Min bɛ yen bi",
  "economy.todayLead": "LOADOUT ekran ka fatɔ ni dugu danw ani dugu ɲɛw (0.6.0) bɛ ɲɛtaa ni ja ɲɛnɛ suguya jira wari ko bɛ min di.",
  "faq.becauseRevenueMeant": "Sabu a ka sɔrɔ ye u sara de ye. Tolon bɛ daminɛ AI ka dilanen ye pewu walasa a ka se ka kɛ; o kɔ ja dilanbaga saralenw bɛ AI ka baara nɔ ta, ni u tɔgɔ sɛbɛnnen ye.",
  "faq.canIPlay": "N bɛ se ka tulon internɛti kan wa?",
  "faq.freePlay": "A bɛ tulon fu wa?",
  "faq.n07Questions": "07 · Ɲininkaliw",
  "faq.notYetLan": "Ayi fɔlɔ. LAN kuntaala jɛlen kelen kan bɛ baara kɛ bi (kabini 0.2.0); internɛti tulon ma dilan.",
  "faq.prototypeWasBuilt": "Misali fɔlɔ dilanna open-source Quake III Arena mɔntɔri kan (GPL), ani Elite Dangerous kurunw ye a hakilijagabɔ ye. Tile filanan na tolon kode taara BuB kan, mɔntɔri kura min sɛbɛnnen bɛ ni Claude Code ye; tolon moduliw bɔra misali fɔlɔ la ka tɔgɔ kura sɔrɔ. Dilanni 0.3.0 ye kurun suguya 16 bɛɛ di fatɔ kura ma. Lisansi bɛnkan lajɛli bɛ ɲini ni kode dɔ bɛ bɔ GPL fɔlɔ la hali bi, ani ni kurun misali fɔlɔw surunyara u hakilijagabɔ la kosɛbɛ. Kode ni GPL misali fɔlɔ ka sɔrɔyɔrɔ ɲɔgɔn suma jateli yɛrɛ yɛrɛ kɛra <0/>, ani a ɲɔgɔn suma lajɛli kɛ ni kunnafonidila ye bɛ taa a ɲɛ. Fɛn o fɛn bɔra a la, a na sɛbɛn kura walima dilan kura. Fo lajɛli ka ban, an tɛ a fɔ ko jaabi ye ayi ye.",
  "faq.questions": "Ɲininkaliw",
  "faq.shipsArtInterface": "Kurunw, ja, intɛrifɛsi ani fɛn wɛrɛw, ka kɛ sɔrɔ ye. <0>Nin ɲɛ kan sɛbɛnni<\/0> bɛ fɛn bɛɛ lisiti, ani a na nɔ ta kelen-kelen bɛɛ jira ni a dilanbaga ye.",
  "faq.shipsUpgradesPlanned": "Kurunw ni kurun ɲɛtaaw latigɛlen bɛ ka se ka sɔrɔ tolon la walima ka san. Kurun saralenw bɛ to bɛnbaga ye cogo min na mɔgɔ ni mɔgɔ kɛlɛ la, o bɛ dilan hali bi.",
  "faq.thatPlanFree": "O de ye latigɛ ye: fu ka tulon ni tolon kɔnɔ wari ani ja ɲɛnɛw ye minnu sɔnni bɛ kɛ. A ma dilan fɔlɔ.",
