  "faq.willPayWin": "A na kɛ sara walasa ka se sɔrɔ ye wa?",
  "faq.windowsPcThere": "Windows PC. Bɔ don ni sɛgɛ si ma sigi fɔlɔ.",
  "footer.anthropicClaudeClaude": "Anthropic, Claude ani Claude Code ye Anthropic, PBC ka taamasyɛnw ye. Unreal Engine ani Epic Games ye Epic Games, Inc. ka taamasyɛnw ye. Blender ye Blender Foundation ka taamasyɛn ye. Quake III Arena ni Elite Dangerous ye u tigiw ka taamasyɛnw ye. Tɔgɔ bɛɛ ye u tigiw ta ye ani u baarakɛra dɔrɔn fɛnw dɔnni kama. Orion-81 tɛ bɔ u si fɛ, u si ma a lafasa, u si ma a sɔn.",
  "footer.aspirationalNoPartnership": "Laɲini dɔrɔn. Jɛkafɔ, bɛnkan walima sɔnni si tɛ yen.",
