  "footer.futurePartners": "Jɛkafɔbagaw nataw?",
  "footer.noTrackersNo": "Tugu minɛn si tɛ. Kukisi si tɛ. Lajɛ sirilan. Tiɲɛ bɛɛ bɛ taa projɛ arisivu la; yan foyi tɛ dɛmɛ ni mɔgɔ ye, ni layidu ye.",
  "footer.notLiveYet": "A ma damine fɔlɔ",
  "footer.oneItemStill": "Fɛn kelen bɛ to ka da: tolon kode <0>lisansi lajɛli<\/0> min bɔra GPL misali fɔlɔ la. Kode ni misali fɔlɔ ka sɔrɔyɔrɔ ɲɔgɔn suma jateli yɛrɛ yɛrɛ kɛra <1/>, ani a ɲɔgɔn suma lajɛli kɛ ni kunnafonidila ye bɛ taa a ɲɛ.",
  "footer.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 ye AI de ka dilanen ye pewu.<\/0> Orion-81 yɛrɛ ka kode Claude Code de ye a sɛbɛn, daminɛbaga ye ɲɛminɛ kɛ; kurunw, kaartiw, ja ɲɛnɛw ani mankanw bɔra dilanminɛnw de fɛ, Claude Code ye minnu sɛbɛn. Open-source jatekɛlaw a bɛ minnu baara kɛ, olu sɛbɛnnen bɛ <1>'AI ma minnu dilan'<\/1> kɔrɔ.",
  "footer.siteFooterAriaLabel": "Sirilan duguma",
