  "why.anthropic": "Anthropic kama",
  "why.anthropicSEconomic": "<0>Anthropic ka Dɔrɔmɛ Index (<1/>)<\/0> b'a sɔrɔ ko baarakɛla kuraw bɛ u ka baara caman ye ko AI bɛ se ka kɛ.",
  "why.anthropicSEconomic2": "<0>Anthropic ka dɔrɔmɛ sariya cogo (<1/>)<\/0> b'a ɲini baarakɛyɔrɔw fɛ u ka mɔgɔw kalan kura ani ka u ta yɔrɔ wɛrɛ ka bɔ u bɔ cogo la.",
